    "pros": [
      "Banned-substance tested, per the brand",
      "Lean label: about 24 g of protein in roughly 120 calories",
      "Large sizes and frequent sales bring the cost down",
      "Huge flavor range"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Not the cheapest per gram at full price",
      "Small tubs are poor value"
    ],
