            Cheap protein powder is about cost per 25 g of protein, not the price on the tub. Work it out once and the pattern is clear: unflavored soy isolate is usually the cheapest gram, Myprotein is a bargain only on sale, and a 5 lb tub of Optimum Nutrition Gold Standard is the best everyday value for most whey buyers.
